,"identity_note":"本固定卷010單元及獨立大阪1670接口內辨識；正文與裴注、引古、書信及作者分域。未補本傳之外出生、母親、任職年代；異名疑讀另留未決。","review":"ai_provisional"},{"id":"e9c_070_567_A","label":"孫氏〔孫策女、顧邵妻〕","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048","mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048:m0079","quote":"女"}],"identity_note":"孫權以兄策女妻顧邵，個人名未記；傳中未指明二子皆出其腹。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048","quote":"邵字孝則，博覽書傳，好樂人倫。少與舅陸績齊名，而陸遜、張敦、卜靜等皆亞焉。自州郡庶幾及四方人士，往來相見，或言議而去，或結厚而別，風聲流聞，遠近稱之。權妻以策女。年二十七，起家爲豫章太守。下車祀先賢徐孺子之墓。優待其後。禁其淫祀非禮之祭者。小吏資質佳者，輒令就學，擇其先進，擢置右職，舉善以教，風化大行。初，錢唐丁諝出於役伍，陽羨張秉生於庶民。烏程呉粲、雲陽殷禮起乎微賤，邵皆拔而友之，爲立聲譽。秉遭大喪，親爲制服結絰。邵當之豫章，發在近路，值秉疾病，時送者百數。邵辭賓客曰：\"張仲節有疾，苦不能來別，恨不見之，暫還與訣，諸君少時相待。\"其留心下士，惟善所在，皆此類也。諝至典軍中郎，秉雲陽太守，禮零陵太守，粲太子少傅。世以邵爲知人。在郡五年，卒官，子譚、承雲。","source_term":"策女"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-wu052-gs-cedaughter","interpretation_note":"本來源明記世代。後綴只供識別。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"e9c_070_567"}},{"id":"syc_ik6_bq5_**AA","label":"顧邵","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","review":"ai_provisional","aliases":[{"surface":"邵","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete:line044:m0084","c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048:m0000","c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048:m0186","c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048:m0210","c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048:m0232","c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048:m0312"]},{"surface":"孝則","mention_ids":["c-sanguozhi-052-gushao-complete:line048:m0002"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozh